@riadmourssali makes a useful point: steady routines can support better sales work. We agree, especially when the routine keeps each client conversation thoughtful and each next step visible.

For self-employed professionals and coaches, try noting what the person needs, choosing one clear next step, and recording when to reconnect. A simple process can help keep chats and follow-ups from slipping through a busy week.

At ActivityTracker, we help sales reps manage clients, chats, follow-ups and targets in one app.
